            "review_text": "No7Kingsclere\nEsher, United Kingdom21 contributions\n0\nCoolest cocktail bar in Saigon!\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nVisited for a pre-dinner drink last night and thought this was the coolest cocktail bar we have visited in Vietnam. Unique and delicious cocktails, served with a smile and great professionalism. The bar itself is minimalist and is very cool. It’s on the 3rd floor with a small terrace to people watch or sit inside and watch the skills of the team making cocktails. Don’t miss this place it’s exceptional and we will be back 🍹\nRead more\nWritten February 3, 2026",
