            "review_title": "Review at RAW + Atelier Café and Cocktail Bars",
            "review_text": "Excursion37520918660\n13 contributions\n0\nAn Essential Saigon Experience: Flawless Cafe to Cocktail Bar Concept\nDec 2025 • Friends\nWe stumbled into this aesthetic place in the center of Saigon near Ben Thanh Market while travelling, and honestly, they treated us like royalty! \nWe came at 5PM for the Cafe: The Café, Matcha Oolong, and Pomelo Teas here were so ridiculously good.\nThen me, our friends and family headed upstairs for the bar around 7 PM: The Cocktail space was like stepping into a whole mood. The hospitality was everything, The cocktail menu was on fire, complemented by great bites and cool seasonal specials as well. Every single corner of this place is a photo op waiting to happen. If you're in Ho Chi Minh City or travel to Vietnam and need a full 4-5 hour mood upgrade (from sublime coffee to killer drinks), i think this would be where you should go try!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 11, 2025",
